{"at":"2026-03-14","by":"human:maple-house","as":"guests-forbidden","op":"assert","text":"Overnight guests are not permitted in the house at any time for any number of nights or in any bedroom; daytime visitors must leave by 10:00 PM.","source":"maple-house.md:109-113"}
